lines = PackedStringArray("New in the village! The mayor said the town was growing, so here I am. Bread on Thursdays.", "These flowers won't water themselves. Well, they would if it rained more.", "Birch makes the best oven fire. Bright, quick, sweet-smelling. Just so you know.")

